|content={{ToggleBox|title=<div style="text-align: center;">[[Build 42.20.0]] Modding News</div>|id=modding-news|class=blue|content=
* New language code: [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/translations/language_codes.html#strew STREW] (joke language), [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/translations/language_codes.html#es-cl ES_CL], [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/translations/language_codes.html#es-mx ES_MX]
* New translation files: mostly for the game, not modding related
* <code>language.txt</code> files changed to JSON based format <code>language.json</code>, see [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/translations/translation_files.html#language here].
* Lots of new world generation files for the [[Lua (API)|Lua]] in <code>media/lua/server/WorldGen</code>
* New function <code>LuaTableUtil:insertAllUniqueElementsFromJavaList(list, array)</code> to insert elements of ArrayLists into a Lua table
* Some new [[Procedural distributions]] and rooms, added to [https://pz-wiki-modding.github.io/PZ-API-Docs/mapping.html PZ API Docs]
* A bunch of new getters and setters for [[Java]] have been added, if you have requests for more, please ask in the [https://discord.com/channels/136501320340209664/1476602902607954043 #mod_portal] channel of the official [[Discord#Official server|Discord server]].
* New [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/ui/UIElement.html#drawTextWithBackground(zombie.ui.UIFont,java.lang.String,double,double,double,double,double,double,double,double,double,double,double,double) drawTextWithBackground] method for UI making.
* Vehicles seem to have had a lot of logic and organization changes, possibly more tools for modders to play with.
* Newly exposed classes are:
** <code>CraftRecipe.XpAward</code>
** <code>StreetPoints</code>
** <code>Transform</code>
** <code>VirtualVehicle</code>
** <code>WorldMapStreet</code>
* [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#getFileWriter(java.lang.String,boolean,boolean) getFileWriter] now is limited to writing files with specific extensions:
** <code>ini</code>
** <code>cfg</code>
** <code>txt</code>
** <code>log</code>
** Interestingly enough, [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#getModFileWriter(java.lang.String,java.lang.String,boolean,boolean) getModFileWriter] didn't get any limitations.
* New [[Networking|sync]] methods were added:
** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendHitZombie(zombie.characters.IsoPlayer) sendHitZombie] (interestingly, instantly marked as deprecated ?)
** Faction related methods:
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#acceptFactionInvite(zombie.characters.Faction,java.lang.String,java.lang.String,boolean) acceptFactionInvite]
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendFactionChangeOwner(zombie.characters.Faction,java.lang.String) sendFactionChangeOwner]
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendFactionChangeTag(zombie.characters.Faction) sendFactionChangeTag]
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendFactionChangeTitle(zombie.characters.Faction,java.lang.String) sendFactionChangeTitle]
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendFactionCreate(java.lang.String,java.lang.String) sendFactionCreate]
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendFactionDisband(zombie.characters.Faction) sendFactionDisband]
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendFactionRemoveMember(zombie.characters.Faction,java.lang.String) sendFactionRemoveMember]
** Foraging related methods:
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendForageRequestZone(zombie.characters.IsoPlayer,java.lang.String) sendForageRequestZone]
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendForagePool(zombie.characters.IsoPlayer,java.lang.String,se.krka.kahlua.vm.KahluaTable) sendForagePool]
*** [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#sendForageSpot(zombie.characters.IsoPlayer,java.lang.String) sendForageSpot]
* Two new [[Lua event]]s:
** RequestMedicalCheck
** AcceptedMedicalCheck
* Vector2 class got a new [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/iso/Vector2.html#mul(float) multiplier method]
* Signs seem to point to [[ActionGroup]] now finally supporting modding, with modded files getting loaded by the game. This should notably allow for modders to use GrappleZed without any manual installation, but also do advanced [[animation]].
}}
{{ToggleBox|title=<div style="text-align: center;">[[Build 42.20.1]] Modding News</div>|id=modding-news-hotfix|class=blue|content=
* <code>json</code> extension is now allowed for [https://albion.codeberg.page/PZ-JavaDocs/zombie/Lua/LuaManager.GlobalObject.html#getFileWriter(java.lang.String,boolean,boolean) getFileWriter] (alongside <code>ini</code>, <code>cfg</code>, <code>txt</code>, <code>log</code>)
* <code>%</code> characters now need to be escaped in the [[translation]]s (e.g. <code>%%</code> for a single <code>%</code> when resolved)
}}
}}<includeonly/>
